=2 Walkthrough
* Speak to {p:Hungry Wolf (A)} at (G-7). He is near Conflux #3.
* You can either purchase a sausage from the {z:Auction House} or create one within Abyssea.
* To create one, trade a {@i:G. Sheep Meat|4372} {i:Giant Sheep Meat} to the **???** on the camp fire at (E-7), near Conflux #6.
* You will receive prompts and have the option to keep going or stop.
** The first message is "The meat appears to be almost done", you may get a {@i:Galkan Sausage|4395} {i:Galkan Sausage|Galkan Sausage|4395}.
** The second message is "A mouthwatering aroma permeates the air", you may get a {@i:Glk. Sausage +1|5859} {i:Galkan Sausage +1|Galkan Sausage +1|5859}.
** The third message is "A burnt smell pervades the air", you may get a {@i:Glk. Sausage +2|5860} {i:Galkan Sausage +2|Galkan Sausage +2|5860}.
** The final message is "An overpowering burnt spell pervades the air", you may get a {@i:Glk. Sausage +3|5861} {i:Galkan Sausage +3|Galkan Sausage +3|5861}.
** There is a chance that the sausage will randomly burn at any point, resulting in a {@i:Glk. Sausage -1|5862} {i:Galkan Sausage -1|Galkan Sausage -1|5862} or nothing. Hungry Wolf will not take Galkan Sausage -1.
* Trade the sausage to {p:Hungry Wolf (A)} to receive your reward.

__Zoning **is** required to repeat this quest.__
